      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds like a much more controlled way to handle it. I really like the idea of maintaining that plateau. \n\nTo make sure I'm being as efficient as possible with this stack, I want to get the timing perfect. If my methylphenidate usually wears off around 4 PM, would it be more effective to take that 150mg dose right as I feel the dip coming on, or should I take it slightly earlier to proactively prevent the drop in focus? Also, in terms of total daily intake, is there a maximum caffeine threshold you'd recommend to stay within that \"sweet spot\" of cognitive enhancement without risking too much cardiovascular strain?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
